    "answer": 0,
    "hint": "The period of $\\sin(bt)$ is $\\frac{2\\pi}{b}$.",
    "explanation": "$\\frac{2\\pi}{2} = \\pi$. The 3 (amplitude) and the $+1$ (midline) do not change the period.",
    "estSeconds": 40,
    "source": "original",
    "verifier": {
      "kind": "js",
      "code": "const f=t=> 3*Math.sin(2*t)+1; const cands=[Math.PI, 2*Math.PI, Math.PI/2, 4*Math.PI]; const ts=h.range(0,50).map(k=>k*0.137); const periodic=p=> ts.every(t=> Math.abs(f(t+p)-f(t))<1e-9); const ok=cands.map(periodic); const smallest=Math.min(...cands.filter((_,i)=>ok[i])); return {index: cands.indexOf(smallest)};"
    }
